## Overview

40 tasks across 7 phases. Estimated 29-39 days. Java source is truth.

## Dependency Graph

```
Phase 1 (Trace Ops) ──┐
                       ├──→ Phase 3 (Maze Search) ──→ Phase 4 (Connection) ──→ Phase 5 (Batch)
Phase 2 (Connectivity) ┘         │
                                  ├──→ Phase 6 (Search Trees)
                                  └──→ Phase 7 (Board Stubs)
```

