_at_tie_pins`) was closed in **WP-10 Inc T (2026-10-06)**, and the whole-plane `shape == null` free space rooms (`AutorouteEngine::complete_expansion_room` WholePlaneShapeTag overload, `ExpansionRoom` whole-plane ctor arm, whole-plane maze-start and expansion-drill rooms) were closed in **WP-10 Inc U (2026-10-07)**.

